hi022-wangqian-62-44"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangqian-ws1477957","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002","quote":"騫性侈於味而儉於服，頗以多忌為累。又惰於接物，雖主書宣敕，或過時不見。才望不及弟暕，特以儉之嫡，故不棄于時。暕為尚書左丞僕射，當朝用事，騫自中書令為郡，邑邑不樂，在郡臥不視事。征復為度支尚書，加給事中，領射聲校尉。以母憂去職。普通三年卒，年四十九。贈侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰安。子規。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002:m0068","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002:m0040","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"弟暕"},"source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi022-wangqian-62-39","source_term":"弟暕"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangqian-ws1477957","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002","quote":"騫性侈於味而儉於服，頗以多忌為累。又惰於接物，雖主書宣敕，或過時不見。才望不及弟暕，特以儉之嫡，故不棄于時。暕為尚書左丞僕射，當朝用事，騫自中書令為郡，邑邑不樂，在郡臥不視事。征復為度支尚書，加給事中，領射聲校尉。以母憂去職。普通三年卒，年四十九。贈侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰安。子規。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002:m0068","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002:m0044","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangqian:p002","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"儉之嫡"},"source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi022-wangqian-62-44","source_term":"儉之嫡"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"兄弟稱謂與其中一人的父子原句合讀，較直接父系證據已存在時沿用。"}},{"id":"v4r_okb_1p2","label":"王暕之母（本傳未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"母","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p001:m0063"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context-ws1544250","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p001","quote":"母","mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p001:m0063"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"卷二十一以母憂去官，所喪之母未明名。王儉與陽羨公主的婚姻本身不足定王暕生母。"}],"source_